#{\footnote # file_menu}${\footnote $ File Menu Commands}K{\footnote K File menu;New;Open;Move;Copy;Delete;Properties;Run;Exit Interface Manager}+{\footnote + commands:010}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 File Menu Commands}\par
\pard\li120\tx2160\sa60 {\b New}\tab Makes a new group or program item.\par
{\b Open}\tab Opens the selected group or starts the selected program.\par
{\b Move}\tab Moves the selected item to another group.\par
{\b Copy}\tab Copies the selected item to another group.\par
{\b Delete}\tab Deletes the selected group or item.\par
{\b Properties}\tab Changes the selected item's title, command line and icon.\par
{\b Run}\tab Runs a program by its command line.\par
{\b Exit Interface Manager}\tab Ends Interface Manager, after asking.\par
\page
#{\footnote # options_menu}${\footnote $ Options Menu Commands}K{\footnote K Options menu;Auto Arrange;Minimize on Use}+{\footnote + commands:020}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Options Menu Commands}\par
\pard\li120\tx2160\sa60 {\b Auto Arrange}\tab Arranges a group's icons whenever it changes.\par
{\b Minimize on Use}\tab Makes Program Manager an icon when a program starts.\par
\page
#{\footnote # window_menu}${\footnote $ Window Menu Commands}K{\footnote K Window menu;Cascade;Tile;Arrange Icons}+{\footnote + commands:030}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Window Menu Commands}\par
\pard\li120\tx2160\sa60 {\b Cascade}\tab Overlaps the open group windows.\par
{\b Tile}\tab Places the open group windows side by side.\par
{\b Arrange Icons}\tab Lines up the icons of the active group.\par
\page
